Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-06T04:36:07-08:00","id":1165549,"title":"","content":"He lost his eye while fighting Mari Kabrah, she also has a claw scar on her belly from that fight. Albreht also lost part of his Left ear from Mari's attack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-06T12:54:42-08:00","id":1165645,"title":"","content":"Nah he had two eyes after his fight with Mari. The injury occurred some point after he Mari and Evan became a pack. The famous encounter between Zhyzak and Albrecht is in the Final Battle story/ The Apocalypse but that's after Kleon Winston locates Zhyzak while Albrecht is looking of her and he puts in a call to Albrecht simply saying &quot;We have her&quot;. I'm pretty sure there's an encounter between the two before that and I think it's pictured on the front of the Storytellers Guide to Garou....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-06T13:49:27-08:00","id":1165662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moirdryd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1165307-how-did-lord-albrecht-lose-his-eye?p=1165645#post1165645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nah he had two eyes after his fight with Mari. The injury occurred some point after he Mari and Evan became a pack. The famous encounter between Zhyzak and Albrecht is in the Final Battle story/ The Apocalypse but that's after Kleon Winston locates Zhyzak while Albrecht is looking of her and he puts in a call to Albrecht simply saying &quot;We have her&quot;. I'm pretty sure there's an encounter between the two before that and I think it's pictured on the front of the Storytellers Guide to Garou....</div> </div> </div> </div>Comics, novels and artwork often contradict eachother. The only time though Albrecht had his eye out, his ear cut off, his throat slashed by garou claws and his chest-belly scared with whole like marks (from wasp talon gift) is in detail depicted in his duel artwork with Mari Cabrah, you will find it nowhere else. And since his appearance supports that version in all WW t A books.<br /> <br /> There is a fight with Albrecht and Zhyzhack in the novel Final Battle, when Zhyzhzck jumped from the Black Labyrinth and she was about to kill Albrecht but she chose to return back to her spiral dancing in order to *Spoilers* promissing she will come bak to finish him off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","user":"Story Letter","date":". 12-06-2017, 04:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T23:24:54-08:00","id":1166635,"title":"","content":"Just from the picture evidence, I'd say he got the scars from his fight with Mari.<br /> <br /> Here is a picture of her claws raking him and the damage they did compared to his face scars;<br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L3c4wNw.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> No, the scars didn't appear on the prequel comic, nor the Silver Crown. But given their location, I'd say this was their origin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T02:57:05-08:00","id":1166666,"title":"","content":"Good job <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar110_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"110\" data-vbnamecard=\"110\">Ana Mizuki</a> you can increase investigation to 5 dots, *thumbs up*.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T07:15:33-08:00","id":1166696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1165307-how-did-lord-albrecht-lose-his-eye?p=1166635#post1166635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just from the picture evidence, I'd say he got the scars from his fight with Mari.<br /> <br /> Here is a picture of her claws raking him and the damage they did compared to his face scars;<br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L3c4wNw.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> No, the scars didn't appear on the prequel comic, nor the Silver Crown. But given their location, I'd say this was their origin.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nice ^^ <br /> Thank you very much \\o/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23580-baskin","name":"Baskin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T15:34:44-08:00","id":1166842,"title":"","content":"I can't remember where, but it got mentioned somewhere (I'm almost certain) that he lost it in a fight with a Black Spiral Dancer. My best recollection is that it happened after the three of them became a pack, but before the events of Silver Crown.<br /> <br /> Actually, no, I DO remember... it was in the intro to the Players' Guide or something, where Heals-The-Past is confronting his tribe for the first time and he's describing this pivotal battle with Black Spirals and how if it had just been a pack of Wendigo, the Spirals would have found a weakness, but the different tribes complement each other. In it he mentions (if memory serves) that Albrecht got his eye plucked out and that he still is debilitated by the injury.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T12:46:47-08:00","id":1167089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1165307-how-did-lord-albrecht-lose-his-eye?p=1166842#post1166842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't remember where, but it got mentioned somewhere (I'm almost certain) that he lost it in a fight with a Black Spiral Dancer. My best recollection is that it happened after the three of them became a pack, but before the events of Silver Crown.<br /> <br /> Actually, no, I DO remember... it was in the intro to the Players' Guide or something, where Heals-The-Past is confronting his tribe for the first time and he's describing this pivotal battle with Black Spirals and how if it had just been a pack of Wendigo, the Spirals would have found a weakness, but the different tribes complement each other. In it he mentions (if memory serves) that Albrecht got his eye plucked out and that he still is debilitated by the injury.</div> </div> </div> </div>Plucked implies some metered, surgical precision. Evan's words there seem to make it sound like they the BSD responsible was just wildly and furiously slashing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T13:03:47-08:00","id":1167395,"title":"","content":"Yep, second edition Players Guide intro story, set after the events of Silver Crown. BSDS nearly claws the eye put and Albrecht is losing sight in it as of the book (which obviously even with his Garou regeneration finally gives out as a BattleScar). Trying to find other references to that fight because I am sure it gets mentioned elsewhere which names the BSD involved, which I still feel is Zhyzak or somehow linked to her. Although I may be muddling names there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T20:02:44-08:00","id":1167490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moirdryd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1165307-how-did-lord-albrecht-lose-his-eye?p=1167395#post1167395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep, second edition Players Guide intro story, set after the events of Silver Crown. BSDS nearly claws the eye put and Albrecht is losing sight in it as of the book (which obviously even with his Garou regeneration finally gives out as a BattleScar). Trying to find other references to that fight because I am sure it gets mentioned elsewhere which names the BSD involved, which I still feel is Zhyzak or somehow linked to her. Although I may be muddling names there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ziggla from the Legacy Rite comic? The two have strangely similar wardrobe choices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-14T03:45:25-08:00","id":1167559,"title":"","content":"Albrecht also has his neck scar from that fight with Mari and his scar marks from her Wasp Talons, which is also depicted in the fight comic of 2nd Edition and W20.<br /> I am not authorised to upload <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-14T04:56:29-08:00","id":1167574,"title":"","content":"Best Werewolf fight sequence EVER, just for the record.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-14T12:17:10-08:00","id":1167736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moirdryd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1165307-how-did-lord-albrecht-lose-his-eye?p=1167574#post1167574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Best Werewolf fight sequence EVER, just for the record.</div> </div> </div> </div>Check also the fight of Mephi and Storm Eye with the wyrm monster, it was the first sequence I have ever seen and I still open the pages of the book only for that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-14T15:44:54-08:00","id":1167783,"title":"","content":"That's what Albrecht wants you to think happened. It was really an incident involving a Red Ryder and silver BB's.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}